Explore Domina Coral Bay and its stunning facilities, plan your visit and activities from your device before and during your visit. Use this app to start planning your stay, and ensure you don’t miss-out on any of the incredible experiences on offer. Contactless check-in can be done before your arrival at your convenience. During your stay the app provides the perfect travel companion, showing what’s on, providing you with fantastic inspiration from the recommended bucket list experiences which you can book directly from the app.  Your itinerary is always accessible to see what adventures you have planned.  
A personal travel assistant in your pocket!
About the Resort:
One of Sharm El Esheik and the Red Seas most fascinating destinations. A holiday resort, spa and casino, situated on an extraordinary private beach , that stretches over  1.8 kilometers..
Domina Coral Bay offers guests a selection of 8 magnificent different  rooms categories, Prestige, Harem, King’s Lake, Elisir,  Sultan, Aquamarine, Bellavista and Oasis, each one with its own personality and concept, totalling 1,115 Rooms & Villas designed to meet everyone’s personal needs and expectations.
